%% Modulo 29 - Casos de uso del MVP entregado
flowchart LR
    QA((Analista QA))
    REV((Revisor con permiso))
    DEV((Responsable del modulo))
    HIS((HIS bajo prueba))

    subgraph API["Modulo 29 - cinco rutas /api/v1/qa"]
        direction TB
        CU1(["POST /api/v1/qa/test-cases<br/>Crear TestCase trazable"])
        CU2(["POST /api/v1/qa/campaigns<br/>Crear RegressionCampaign"])
        CU3(["POST /api/v1/qa/campaigns/{campaign}/executions<br/>Registrar TestExecution y Evidence"])
        CU4(["POST /api/v1/qa/defects/{defect}/retests<br/>Registrar fixed_version y re-prueba"])
        CU5(["GET /api/v1/qa/campaigns/{campaign}/matrix<br/>Consultar matriz"])
    end

    QA --- CU1
    QA --- CU2
    QA --- CU3
    QA --- CU4
    QA --- CU5
    REV --- CU5
    DEV -. comunica fixed_version a QA .-> CU4
    QA -->|ejecuta pasos manualmente| HIS
    HIS -->|resultado observado| QA

    CU3 -. si status es FAILED crea Defect OPEN .-> CU5
    CU4 -. PASSED cierra; FAILED o BLOCKED reabre .-> CU5

    AUTH["tenant + jwt.auth<br/>qa.regression.manage"]
    AUTH --- API
    LOCAL["Persistencia QA HOSPITAL-local<br/>target_scope CENTRAL o HOSPITAL"]
    API --- LOCAL

    style API fill:#f3f8ff,stroke:#24527a,stroke-width:2px
    style LOCAL fill:#fff8e8,stroke:#8a6419
